    "detailed_description": "<h1>Play for free!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tempted but not ready to commit? Play the full game for free, then if you like it come back to support a guy just trying to make cool games :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search &quot;Suspicious Shuffle: Free For All&quot; on Steam</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Mario Party meets Geometry Wars in this minigame adventure for 1-6 players!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398300/extras/0ad35720dba860f750ed081488f46f52.webp?t=1734831944\" /></div><br>Play through a <strong>1-6 player co-op campaign</strong> (approx. 4-5 hours) utilizing a diverse set of skills in a ever-Shuffling <strong>29</strong> minigame fiesta! In the process, enjoy a light-hearted story involving the Suspicious Dealer and restoring balance to the universe. The stakes have never been lower!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398300/extras/b34069a6980d69cd2905a8a6ed432592.webp?t=1734831944\" /></div><br>Is an adventure really complete without hats? Clearing the campaign rewards you with priceless Stars which can be used to unlock customisation options and get fancy!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398300/extras/dfbf686d870f9f3987f1bec1fdb615e6.webp?t=1734831944\" /></div><br>Sometimes we all need a break from helping one other to show off and find out who really is the very best. It'll be you, obviously. Prove it over <strong>18</strong> PvP minigames.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398300/extras/98ee3e5bc61e234adda3beff03f598ee.webp?t=1734831944\" /></div><br>Mix and match your favorite minigames with modifiable settings to play them the way <strong>you</strong> like them, no judgement.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398300/extras/397a79903686e27683acb385ad419f22.webp?t=1734831944\" /></div><br>Guaranteed fun or refund it in &lt; 2 hours for 100% of your money back! Okay you got me, admittedly that's just a Steam Store rule but what I'm trying to say is: What'dya got to lose? Everybody get in here!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Mario Party meets Geometry Wars in this minigame adventure for 1-6 players!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398300/extras/0ad35720dba860f750ed081488f46f52.webp?t=1734831944\" /></div><br>Play through a <strong>1-6 player co-op campaign</strong> (approx. 4-5 hours) utilizing a diverse set of skills in a ever-Shuffling <strong>29</strong> minigame fiesta! In the process, enjoy a light-hearted story involving the Suspicious Dealer and restoring balance to the universe. The stakes have never been lower!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398300/extras/b34069a6980d69cd2905a8a6ed432592.webp?t=1734831944\" /></div><br>Is an adventure really complete without hats? Clearing the campaign rewards you with priceless Stars which can be used to unlock customisation options and get fancy!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398300/extras/dfbf686d870f9f3987f1bec1fdb615e6.webp?t=1734831944\" /></div><br>Sometimes we all need a break from helping one other to show off and find out who really is the very best. It'll be you, obviously. Prove it over <strong>18</strong> PvP minigames.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398300/extras/98ee3e5bc61e234adda3beff03f598ee.webp?t=1734831944\" /></div><br>Mix and match your favorite minigames with modifiable settings to play them the way <strong>you</strong> like them, no judgement.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398300/extras/397a79903686e27683acb385ad419f22.webp?t=1734831944\" /></div><br>Guaranteed fun or refund it in &lt; 2 hours for 100% of your money back! Okay you got me, admittedly that's just a Steam Store rule but what I'm trying to say is: What'dya got to lose? Everybody get in here!",
